Note on quoted material: The `references/masters-*.md` files contain very
brief, attributed quotations (one or two lines each) from poems by living
Chinese poets (Zhang Ergun, Jiang Fei, Yu Jian, Zhai Yongming, Hai Nan,
Zheng Xiaoqiong), used solely for craft analysis and teaching comparison.
These quotations remain the property of their authors and are NOT licensed
under this MIT License.
